SPEC = {"beats": [{"vo": "Zeno's paradox argues this man can never reach that door. First he has to walk halfway. Then half of what's left. Then half of THAT. The halves never run out, so... does he ever get there? Watch. A half. Then a quarter. An eighth. A sixteenth. Each step closes half the gap that's left, so the total gets closer and closer to the whole distance. Infinitely many pieces... and together they add up to EXACTLY the whole way. And the time? Each piece takes half as long to walk, so the times add up to a few ordinary seconds. [warmly] So yes, he gets there. In calculus, that's an infinite series that converges."}]}
